    "text": "<p>Unit of Pascal is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p><p>So, dimension of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Pascal</mi><mo>&#8208;</mo><mi>sec</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;</p>"
